“Our engineers are designing Aptera for efficiency, range, comfort, durability, and safety. We won’t know Aptera’s actual rating until we pass a production vehicle through the full safety test.
The previous version had the highest roof crush strength of all passenger cars on the road! It performed exceedingly well in actual side and frontal crash tests.”

